flowchart TB
    A[Slow Dependency] --> B[Uncertainty]
    B --> C[Retries]
    C --> D[Duplicate Work]
    D --> E[Deeper Queues]
    E --> F[Tail Latency]
    F --> G[Stale Reads / Delayed Writes]
    G --> H[False Success]
    H --> C

    I[Controls] --> J[Idempotency]
    I --> K[Retry Budgets]
    I --> L[Pending State]
    I --> M[Clear Commit Messages]
